// siblings (NUKAGE2/3, SLIME02-04/06-08, BLOOD2/3, LAVA1-4) are checked directly because
// nothing consolidates them into NUKAGE1/SLIME01/SLIME05/BLOOD1 via ReplaceTextures any more.
